<!-- $title = Enslain Metal Merch - About-->
<!-- @include "partials/_header.kit" -->
<main class="main">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="grid grid--two-col">
        <div class="text-container">
          <h1>About Enslain Metal Merch</h1>
          <p>Above anything, what we are is fans of heavy music, and this can be seen from our spirit, passion, and dedication to
          doing quality work, with an emphasis on relating to the fans, and delivering speedy and friendly service.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="img-container"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570824104453-508955ab713e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2811&q=80" alt=""></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <h2>Meet the Enslain Crew</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--two-col">
        <div class="text-container">
          <h3>Chrissy Hujanen</h3>
          <p>Enslain is owned by Chrissy Hujanen, aka Lady Enslain, who has been working in the music industry as a promotor,
          journalist and photographer, in addition to having sold merchandise on metal tours in North America and Europe since
          1999.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="img-container"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571570703598-39eb580a0329?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2944&q=80" alt=""></div>
      </div>
